List-Id: linux-scsi@vger.kernel.org

This patch advances all qed* drivers to use firmware 8.33.1.0.
This includes:
Modify core driver (qed) to utilize the new FW and initialize the device
with it. This is the lion's share of the patch, and includes changes to FW
interface files, device initialization flows, FW interaction flows, and
debug collection flows.
Modify Ethernet driver (qede) to make use of new FW in fastpath.
Modify RoCE/iWARP driver (qedr) to make use of new FW in fastpath.
Modify FCoE driver (qedf) to make use of new FW in fastpath.
Modify iSCSI driver (qedi) to make use of new FW in fastpath.

The changes are mostly in qed, and include changes in the FW interface
files, as well as updating the FW initialization and debug collection
code. Some modifications fix styling issues, and some are renaming ones
to allow distinction between different types of HW.
The protocol drivers have minor functional changes for this firmware.

